      "statement": "Util.getBrandId() identifies the card network from the PAN using regexes: amex for (34|37) prefix, cup for 62 prefix, jcb for 35 prefix, mastercard for (2|5)-prefixed 16-digit, and visa for 4-prefixed 16-digit; getCardByNumber() returns the matching short brand code (VC, MC, JC, AE, CUP).",
