      "id": "claim_459e0316dc53497493cff09247356508",
      "statement": "The instrumentMatchs static map in InvoiceService translates brand codes (VC, MC, JC, AE, CUP, PAYPAL, MOMO, ZALOPAY, SMARTPAY, VIETTELPAY, VNPTMONEY, mPAYvn, bidvpayplus, MyVIB) and BIN prefixes into semicolon-delimited instrument patterns (type;swiftCode;brand;) used to match against merchant accept_instruments configuration; GooglePayInvoice adds an APPLEPAY entry mapping to applepay;;applepay;.",
