    {
      "id": "claim_4c05fd63c9994d5daae794de1e58b063",
      "statement": "Vietnamese domestic bank ATM cards are BIN-routed: BIN prefixes in instrumentMatchs ending in 1 (e.g. 9704181) map to np_card with the NAPAS SWIFT variant (e.g. BIDVVNVXNP), while base BINs (e.g. 970418) map to card with the standard SWIFT code (e.g. BIDVVNVX); a minority map to account types such as techcombank_account, dongabank_account, and vib_account for internet banking.",
      "evidence": [
